+    ⭐ AND A CHEAPER ONE WOULD NOT BE WANTED IF IT COULD BE. Portrait draw size
+    is chosen by VIEWPORT, never by quality tier:
+    `DialogLayoutProfile::for_viewport` picks 56x62, 82x94 or 104x120 and
+    consults no quality setting. Against a 256x320 authored frame, `0_25x`
